(188136, 10954, 3080, '<td valign="top">There is a rock like this in Pineville KY.  Up on the walk to chain rock.  Anyway, I like the photo.  Made me laugh for sure.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I am glad you backed up and included a lot of the rock.  I think a close up would have lacked the humor effect.  Lighting conditions look like they were nice for the shot.  The focus and clarity are also good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There is a rock like this in Pineville KY.  Up on the walk to chain rock.  Anyway, I like the photo.  Made me laugh for sure.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I am glad you backed up and included a lot of the rock.  I think a close up would have lacked the humor effect.  Lighting conditions look like they were nice for the shot.  The focus and clarity are also good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 00:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
