(188765, 10782, 2363, '<td valign="top">Rather grainy - try either the "Despeckle" tool in your paint program or download Neat Image to reduce the effect of noise on your photo. Perhaps slightly over exposed - no detail is visible in the majority of the white fur. Not what I would consider a "laugh out loud" photo, which is what the challenge asked for. You''re also on shakey ground using a pet in your photo because unless the photo is technically stunning, people are going to tend to vote you down.</td>', 'Rather grainy - try either the "Despeckle" tool in your paint program or download Neat Image to reduce the effect of noise on your photo. Perhaps slightly over exposed - no detail is visible in the majority of the white fur. Not what I would consider a "laugh out loud" photo, which is what the challenge asked for. You''re also on shakey ground using a pet in your photo because unless the photo is technically stunning, people are going to tend to vote you down.', '2003-01-13 10:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
