(189256, 10938, 2170, '<td valign="top">MMMMMM...IKEA......*drroooooooooollllll*<br/> <br/>The lighting underneath the cracker is pretty harsh.  It might be easier to look at if it were darker.  And the reflection in the knife handle takes away from the photo.</td>', 'MMMMMM...IKEA......*drroooooooooollllll* The lighting underneath the cracker is pretty harsh.  It might be easier to look at if it were darker.  And the reflection in the knife handle takes away from the photo.', '2003-01-13 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
