(189880, 10883, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice job and he plays beautifully.  I wonder how this would have looked with just the paw on the keys.  It would have taken the head out which is slightly out of focus.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice job and he plays beautifully.  I wonder how this would have looked with just the paw on the keys.  It would have taken the head out which is slightly out of focus.  Good job.', '2003-01-13 23:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
