(189912, 10813, 3080, '<td valign="top">This really did make me laugh.  It''s perfect.  It looks just like the plant is reaching out to get a drink.  I love the background.  Perfect for the shot.  Nothing distracting.  Lighting is good. No distracting shadows, no hot spots.  You did an excelent job keeping reflection and glare off the glass.  I only wish the plant didn''t look spray painted.  minor detail though.  Great focus and clarity.  Very nice. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This really did make me laugh.  It''s perfect.  It looks just like the plant is reaching out to get a drink.  I love the background.  Perfect for the shot.  Nothing distracting.  Lighting is good. No distracting shadows, no hot spots.  You did an excelent job keeping reflection and glare off the glass.  I only wish the plant didn''t look spray painted.  minor detail though.  Great focus and clarity.  Very nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 23:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(189924, 10887, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  Focus and clarity are very nice.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the right of the photo, on her shirt.  I have a 2 year old, so this made me smile.  He HATES getting anything on his hands, face, or clothes, so I don''t have any of these kinds of pics.  She is a cutie. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great DOF.  Focus and clarity are very nice.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the right of the photo, on her shirt.  I have a 2 year old, so this made me smile.  He HATES getting anything on his hands, face, or clothes, so I don''t have any of these kinds of pics.  She is a cutie. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 23:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(189928, 11045, 3205, '<td valign="top">Great composition!  It seems a little over exposed to me, but that may just be my monitor,  Great imagination!</td>', 'Great composition!  It seems a little over exposed to me, but that may just be my monitor,  Great imagination!', '2003-01-13 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
