(189938, 10883, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus on the keys and kitties paw is very nice.  I do not mind at all that the kitty is not in focus, that way, it draws attention to the kitty and the keys.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  lighting is good, maybe a TAD harsh on the left side of the kitties face, but nothing serious.  Made me smile.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Focus on the keys and kitties paw is very nice.  I do not mind at all that the kitty is not in focus, that way, it draws attention to the kitty and the keys.  I like the angle and framing/cropping as well.  lighting is good, maybe a TAD harsh on the left side of the kitties face, but nothing serious.  Made me smile.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 23:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
