(189956, 10979, 3080, '<td valign="top">Photos of cows always make me laugh, cause I am reminded of a little joke I got in an email when I first got internet.  Anyway, I think the shot is very nice.  The angle and framing are good.  I like how you have the entire shadow of the cow in the shot.  The lighting seems a bit strange around his eyes.  maybe kind of too bright?  oh well, he''s still a cutie.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Photos of cows always make me laugh, cause I am reminded of a little joke I got in an email when I first got internet.  Anyway, I think the shot is very nice.  The angle and framing are good.  I like how you have the entire shadow of the cow in the shot.  The lighting seems a bit strange around his eyes.  maybe kind of too bright?  oh well, he''s still a cutie.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 23:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(189960, 10889, 4615, '<td valign="top">That is funny.  Is that how they put the holes in the donuts there?</td>', 'That is funny.  Is that how they put the holes in the donuts there?', '2003-01-13 23:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(189962, 10819, 4615, '<td valign="top">I guess you could call it local coloUr.</td>', 'I guess you could call it local coloUr.', '2003-01-13 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(189965, 10878, 3080, '<td valign="top">Black fur is so hard to capture nicely.  It all seems to blend in together, and you don''t know where feet stop and ears begin.  It is a strange sight though, the dog and cat cuddled up with the tiny puppy.  I wish the object that the cat is resting on wasn''t black..  Focus and clarity are good, love the little wrinkles on the puppy.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Black fur is so hard to capture nicely.  It all seems to blend in together, and you don''t know where feet stop and ears begin.  It is a strange sight though, the dog and cat cuddled up with the tiny puppy.  I wish the object that the cat is resting on wasn''t black..  Focus and clarity are good, love the little wrinkles on the puppy.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-13 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(189966, 10836, 4615, '<td valign="top">too sad to me humorous!</td>', 'too sad to me humorous!', '2003-01-13 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(189971, 10935, 3080, '<td valign="top">Oh, the shadow around his head on the pillow is really not attractive to the photo.  Looks like it might have been a hard place to get good lighting on, but the shadow is just a bit harsh.  I like how he dozed off by the computer.  I''ve been there a few times in my life.  The color in the shot is good.  Focus is maybe a little soft, however, not enough to be damaging.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh, the shadow around his head on the pillow is really not attractive to the photo.  Looks like it might have been a hard place to get good lighting on, but the shadow is just a bit harsh.  I like how he dozed off by the computer.  I''ve been there a few times in my life.  The color in the shot is good.  Focus is maybe a little soft, however, not enough to be damaging.  Nice find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(189975, 10738, 3080, '<td valign="top">The background is burning my eyes. lol.  Lighting is a big harsh here.  SOme blown out white spots on their ears, and the background is overwhelming.  The color is nice though, and focus and clarity are good.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok, cause I like symetry, and you definately have that.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The background is burning my eyes. lol.  Lighting is a big harsh here.  SOme blown out white spots on their ears, and the background is overwhelming.  The color is nice though, and focus and clarity are good.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok, cause I like symetry, and you definately have that.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(189980, 10986, 3080, '<td valign="top">Pathetic isn''t the word.  Not really funny to me.  I think the only thing you have going for you in this shot is the focus and the framing/cropping.  Lighting is pretty bad, it gets a bit dark to the left side, not really evened out at all.  good job of leveling your strong horizontal line with the frame of the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Pathetic isn''t the word.  Not really funny to me.  I think the only thing you have going for you in this shot is the focus and the framing/cropping.  Lighting is pretty bad, it gets a bit dark to the left side, not really evened out at all.  good job of leveling your strong horizontal line with the frame of the photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(190025, 10828, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is kind of a distraction.  Funny though, how he''s laying on his back.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  The tight crop works well in my opinion.  too bad he doesn''t have his tongue sticking out.  my dog used to do that all the time.  cute dog. focus is also ok.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting here is kind of a distraction.  Funny though, how he''s laying on his back.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose for this.  The tight crop works well in my opinion.  too bad he doesn''t have his tongue sticking out.  my dog used to do that all the time.  cute dog. focus is also ok.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(190028, 10991, 3080, '<td valign="top">ok, this is very funny.  The redness of the hand though is a bit odd to me.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the focus and clarity are great.  I like the background very much, totally black, nothing distracting.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  I guess my only suggestion is to tone down the red.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'ok, this is very funny.  The redness of the hand though is a bit odd to me.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping is nice, and the focus and clarity are great.  I like the background very much, totally black, nothing distracting.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  I guess my only suggestion is to tone down the red.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(190034, 10782, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess you''d have to be there to get the full humor in this.  it''s strange, but I can''t really figure out what the heck it''s doing.  I assume from the title that that is a sock in it''s mouth.  Your focus and clarity are ok.  lighting is alright as well.  I think that if you could have blurred the background, that might have helped.  I realize not everyone has this option, so just ignore me if you dont.  if you DO though, work with it.  I just learned DOF on my new camera, and it''s a miracle worker.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I guess you''d have to be there to get the full humor in this.  it''s strange, but I can''t really figure out what the heck it''s doing.  I assume from the title that that is a sock in it''s mouth.  Your focus and clarity are ok.  lighting is alright as well.  I think that if you could have blurred the background, that might have helped.  I realize not everyone has this option, so just ignore me if you dont.  if you DO though, work with it.  I just learned DOF on my new camera, and it''s a miracle worker.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(190037, 10727, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks like it was difficult for this shot.  Some blown out areas on the owl.  Not too bad though.  Focus and clarity are good.  I like the angle and framing/cropping very much.  The blank space in front of his face is good.  The colors seem a bit muted.  Was that a result of the harsh lighting?  I wonder if some saturation level adjustments would help at all.  worth a try anyway.  What a pretty animal.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lighting looks like it was difficult for this shot.  Some blown out areas on the owl.  Not too bad though.  Focus and clarity are good.  I like the angle and framing/cropping very much.  The blank space in front of his face is good.  The colors seem a bit muted.  Was that a result of the harsh lighting?  I wonder if some saturation level adjustments would help at all.  worth a try anyway.  What a pretty animal.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(190041, 11021, 3080, '<td valign="top">The scary thing is, this looks like a natural thing for you. LOL  I love how it comes in matching sets with the antenae.  :)  Quite funny.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  Focus and clarity are great.  Very nice job keeping reflection and glare off all the glass in the photo.  There is a bit there, however, it''s not distracting at all.  The lighting worked out nicely as well.  Nothing too bright, nothing too dark.  Great creativity. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The scary thing is, this looks like a natural thing for you. LOL  I love how it comes in matching sets with the antenae.  :)  Quite funny.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  Focus and clarity are great.  Very nice job keeping reflection and glare off all the glass in the photo.  There is a bit there, however, it''s not distracting at all.  The lighting worked out nicely as well.  Nothing too bright, nothing too dark.  Great creativity. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(190042, 10926, 3080, '<td valign="top">He''s funny, but the photo its self isn''t really funny. Oh well.  I like dopey anyway. The color is very nice, and I like to DOF as well.  Nice focus and clarity.  Technically, this is nicely done.  Only a slight glare on his forehead.  I like the background, nothing distracting there.  Lighting appears to have been good for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He''s funny, but the photo its self isn''t really funny. Oh well.  I like dopey anyway. The color is very nice, and I like to DOF as well.  Nice focus and clarity.  Technically, this is nicely done.  Only a slight glare on his forehead.  I like the background, nothing distracting there.  Lighting appears to have been good for the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(190045, 10848, 3080, '<td valign="top">Try cropping this to right above the hay bales.  I like how it looks that way.  The color seems more balanced without the dull colors of the sky and trees.  NOT your fault the colors are dull, looks like it''s just that time of the year.  I''m sitting here cropping it with the top of my screen, and I like it very much.  The angle is great.  Love how they are all just looking at you like you''re crazy.  The border looks very nice with the photo as well.  Focus and clarity are great, and lighting on the subjects is excelent.  The only thing I would like to see is a different crop.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Try cropping this to right above the hay bales.  I like how it looks that way.  The color seems more balanced without the dull colors of the sky and trees.  NOT your fault the colors are dull, looks like it''s just that time of the year.  I''m sitting here cropping it with the top of my screen, and I like it very much.  The angle is great.  Love how they are all just looking at you like you''re crazy.  The border looks very nice with the photo as well.  Focus and clarity are great, and lighting on the subjects is excelent.  The only thing I would like to see is a different crop.  Great shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 00:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
