(190220, 10886, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hah, from the thumbnail this looked very bad indeed, but it''s just a play on that sad old setzler thing that''s been beat dead over and over again ... but anyway it deserves a chuckle or two. :-)</td>', 'Hah, from the thumbnail this looked very bad indeed, but it''s just a play on that sad old setzler thing that''s been beat dead over and over again ... but anyway it deserves a chuckle or two. :-)', '2003-01-14 04:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
