(190230, 10848, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hahahahah, good one, and a great shot!</td>', 'Hahahahah, good one, and a great shot!', '2003-01-14 04:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(190231, 10883, 3900, '<td valign="top">Oh, are you holding Pounce up there?   Cheese, salmon, tuna?  Very cute.</td>', 'Oh, are you holding Pounce up there?   Cheese, salmon, tuna?  Very cute.', '2003-01-14 04:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(190233, 10819, 2337, '<td valign="top">LoL... Aside from being Hmor, it''s well shot :)</td>', 'LoL... Aside from being Hmor, it''s well shot :)', '2003-01-14 04:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(190236, 10782, 3900, '<td valign="top">Hahah, great shot, she must''ve been really excited because both her back legs are at the same position, in the air, like she just jumped up.  And her markings remind me of a cat that we lost recently at a young age.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Hahah, great shot, she must''ve been really excited because both her back legs are at the same position, in the air, like she just jumped up.  And her markings remind me of a cat that we lost recently at a young age.  Nice capture!', '2003-01-14 04:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(190240, 10738, 5364, '<td valign="top">Easily the funniest</td>', 'Easily the funniest', '2003-01-14 04:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(190306, 10813, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great fun, nice effort.  I would have prefered white wine myself.<br/> <br/>The image may have been better if there was a way to backfill the shadow areas with a bit more light.  Not necessarily another flash, but a reflector would have been good.  All the same, my pick of the week. 8  Morgan</td>', 'Great fun, nice effort.  I would have prefered white wine myself. The image may have been better if there was a way to backfill the shadow areas with a bit more light.  Not necessarily another flash, but a reflector would have been good.  All the same, my pick of the week. 8  Morgan', '2003-01-14 08:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190307, 10886, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great fun, and a very creative poke at John.  Great lighting, set design, make-up, etc.  I could not laugh more.....</td>', 'Great fun, and a very creative poke at John.  Great lighting, set design, make-up, etc.  I could not laugh more.....', '2003-01-14 08:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(190322, 11039, 3585, '<td valign="top">interesting botanical phenomenon, but, lets face it, not frankly hillarious.</td>', 'interesting botanical phenomenon, but, lets face it, not frankly hillarious.', '2003-01-14 08:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(190324, 11015, 3585, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the profile view was the best choice. Also, from my own experience, spinach gives much better results.</td>', 'I''m not sure the profile view was the best choice. Also, from my own experience, spinach gives much better results.', '2003-01-14 08:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(190325, 10960, 3080, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing the humor in this photograph.  The humor is in the title, but the photo didn''t make me laugh.  Technically, it''s very nicely done.  Nice bright color, great focus and clarity.  LIghting is very nice to produce the black background, which I like as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing the humor in this photograph.  The humor is in the title, but the photo didn''t make me laugh.  Technically, it''s very nicely done.  Nice bright color, great focus and clarity.  LIghting is very nice to produce the black background, which I like as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 08:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190326, 10974, 3585, '<td valign="top">Yellow in, red out would have made some sense. A little to far fetched but fun.</td>', 'Yellow in, red out would have made some sense. A little to far fetched but fun.', '2003-01-14 08:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(190330, 10938, 3080, '<td valign="top">There is something strange about the lighting in this shot.  Maybe seems too yellow to me.  Do you have white balance settings?  If not, you could try to adjust in a photoediter.  I think the reflections on the knife are a bit distracting, due to the fact that there aren''t any on the fork.  There is quite a large shadow being cast from the cracker.  Doesn''t seem like it would produce that big of a shadow, so I assume then, that it''s a thick cracker.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  Direct overhead is definately the way to go on this shot.  Focus is also good.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There is something strange about the lighting in this shot.  Maybe seems too yellow to me.  Do you have white balance settings?  If not, you could try to adjust in a photoediter.  I think the reflections on the knife are a bit distracting, due to the fact that there aren''t any on the fork.  There is quite a large shadow being cast from the cracker.  Doesn''t seem like it would produce that big of a shadow, so I assume then, that it''s a thick cracker.  I like the angle and framing/cropping.  Direct overhead is definately the way to go on this shot.  Focus is also good.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 08:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190331, 11045, 6097, '<td valign="top">I must say that I think this was the most creative shot for HUMOR.  I wasn\''t able to come up with anything decent so I didn\''t even enter the challenge.  Perhaps I should have called you for some ideas?  :-)  This is also the only photo I viewed in the challenge that actually made me chuckle without first reading the title.</td>', 'I must say that I think this was the most creative shot for HUMOR.  I wasn\''t able to come up with anything decent so I didn\''t even enter the challenge.  Perhaps I should have called you for some ideas?  :-)  This is also the only photo I viewed in the challenge that actually made me chuckle without first reading the title.', '2003-01-14 08:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(190332, 10738, 3585, '<td valign="top">Saved by the caption</td>', 'Saved by the caption', '2003-01-14 08:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(190333, 10839, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Egg-selent focus and clarity. (ok, sorry, that was bad)  The texture and detail on the egg just jumps out.  The background is great.  Nothing distracting there.  I like the DOF.  Lighting is great.  You did a great job with this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Egg-selent focus and clarity. (ok, sorry, that was bad)  The texture and detail on the egg just jumps out.  The background is great.  Nothing distracting there.  I like the DOF.  Lighting is great.  You did a great job with this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 08:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(190336, 10982, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not rolling on the floor laughing, but the shot is kind of cute.  The focus is a tad soft for my personal taste.  I''d like to see the dogs face a bit more crisp.  The look is precious.  The dogs black fur on it''s back blends in with the background and we kind of lose where the background ends and the dog starts.  The angle and framing/cropping is very nice. I like having the dog toward the top of the photo, and the laundry growing all around it.  Cute dog.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not rolling on the floor laughing, but the shot is kind of cute.  The focus is a tad soft for my personal taste.  I''d like to see the dogs face a bit more crisp.  The look is precious.  The dogs black fur on it''s back blends in with the background and we kind of lose where the background ends and the dog starts.  The angle and framing/cropping is very nice. I like having the dog toward the top of the photo, and the laundry growing all around it.  Cute dog.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(190339, 10889, 3585, '<td valign="top">To many of us this will more frightning than amusing, good solid photojournalism shot. There is still hope, the place does not seem mobed.</td>', 'To many of us this will more frightning than amusing, good solid photojournalism shot. There is still hope, the place does not seem mobed.', '2003-01-14 08:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(190340, 10836, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, at first, it''s sad.  Then it''s kind of funny. lol.  Poor thing!  I''m wondering "how can he stand on only one leg".  Then realized that they stand on one leg most of the time anyway.  He looks like he''s very used to it by now.  Focus and clarity are good.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting appears to have been cooperative for the shot. and I love the background.  It''s not a solid color, there is just enough variation to make it interesting, however, blurred enough to not make it distracting.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, at first, it''s sad.  Then it''s kind of funny. lol.  Poor thing!  I''m wondering "how can he stand on only one leg".  Then realized that they stand on one leg most of the time anyway.  He looks like he''s very used to it by now.  Focus and clarity are good.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting appears to have been cooperative for the shot. and I love the background.  It''s not a solid color, there is just enough variation to make it interesting, however, blurred enough to not make it distracting.  Nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(190343, 10920, 3080, '<td valign="top">She looks like she had fun with this shot.  My only suggestion, is to try to reduce the shadow behind her.  The backgound is nice, not distracting, however, the shadow kind of is, in my opinion.  Just noticed that she also has a bit of red eye, and I think most cameras come with the ''red eye reducer'' thing.  Not all, so if not, no big deal, but it could have helped in this case.  focus and clarity are good.  angle and framing/cropping are also good.  personality really shows here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'She looks like she had fun with this shot.  My only suggestion, is to try to reduce the shadow behind her.  The backgound is nice, not distracting, however, the shadow kind of is, in my opinion.  Just noticed that she also has a bit of red eye, and I think most cameras come with the ''red eye reducer'' thing.  Not all, so if not, no big deal, but it could have helped in this case.  focus and clarity are good.  angle and framing/cropping are also good.  personality really shows here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 09:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(190345, 10734, 3080, '<td valign="top">Man....I''m gonna have to flag this one for nudity. LOL.  Just kidding.  This is actually quite funny for anyone who has every tried to take a photo of a person.  You say that so much that this is a likely reaction if it were possible.  I like the angle and framing/cropping and the focus is good as well.  My only other comment is that the background white kind of absorbs your subject to the right.  Her hair almost totally blends into the background.  Not a huge problem though.  Very funny.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Man....I''m gonna have to flag this one for nudity. LOL.  Just kidding.  This is actually quite funny for anyone who has every tried to take a photo of a person.  You say that so much that this is a likely reaction if it were possible.  I like the angle and framing/cropping and the focus is good as well.  My only other comment is that the background white kind of absorbs your subject to the right.  Her hair almost totally blends into the background.  Not a huge problem though.  Very funny.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 09:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(190348, 10797, 3585, '<td valign="top">In this classical comic sequence: approach - amused  anticipation - slip - fly -fall - recovery in pain, you chose one of the rare moments devoid of comic strenght. Well done picture otherwise</td>', 'In this classical comic sequence: approach - amused  anticipation - slip - fly -fall - recovery in pain, you chose one of the rare moments devoid of comic strenght. Well done picture otherwise', '2003-01-14 09:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(190351, 10839, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, would have had more strength with a little more: shadow of a golfer, club in movement, golfer shoes etc. good image but a bit lazy.</td>', 'Fun idea, would have had more strength with a little more: shadow of a golfer, club in movement, golfer shoes etc. good image but a bit lazy.', '2003-01-14 09:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(190353, 11013, 3080, '<td valign="top">If the TP didn''t look like it was tied around the belt, I think this would be funnier.  Still pretty funny.  And brave too...no WAY would I ever photograph my bathroom.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok.  Something about not being level is odd, but not nesissarily bad.  Lighting and colors are good.  Focus and clarity are also nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If the TP didn''t look like it was tied around the belt, I think this would be funnier.  Still pretty funny.  And brave too...no WAY would I ever photograph my bathroom.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok.  Something about not being level is odd, but not nesissarily bad.  Lighting and colors are good.  Focus and clarity are also nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 09:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(190356, 11014, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty nice shot, but alone, it''s not really funny.  With the title is is kind of funny.  I''m being pretty laid back with that, so not a huge deal.  The focus and clarity are good.  I think that the crop is too tight on the right.  I''d personally like to see those last few lashes.  Those are usually the most impressive, and longest, and I think that it would enhance the good focus to see those crisp lashes.  Lighting looks good for the shot.  i like the catch lights.  Nice detail.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a pretty nice shot, but alone, it''s not really funny.  With the title is is kind of funny.  I''m being pretty laid back with that, so not a huge deal.  The focus and clarity are good.  I think that the crop is too tight on the right.  I''d personally like to see those last few lashes.  Those are usually the most impressive, and longest, and I think that it would enhance the good focus to see those crisp lashes.  Lighting looks good for the shot.  i like the catch lights.  Nice detail.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(190357, 10839, 6182, '<td valign="top">I  really love the concept here and it is a very nicely executed photo but the date mark is really distracting and takes away from the form of the egg in my humble opinion.</td>', 'I  really love the concept here and it is a very nicely executed photo but the date mark is really distracting and takes away from the form of the egg in my humble opinion.', '2003-01-14 09:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(190358, 10734, 3585, '<td valign="top">Works without a caption, good job</td>', 'Works without a caption, good job', '2003-01-14 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(190359, 10921, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have never seen rugby played, nor do I know anything about it.  Is there even a ball??  Other than a few guys with awesome leg muscles, I''m not really sure what''s going on here.  That''s my fault though, not yours.  My only complaint is a small one.  The guy to the left in blue, has his hands out, but the shadow from the right arm is covering part of the left hand, kind of making it blend into the background.  Otherwise, lighting and focus are good. angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how you have gotten all 3 guys in the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have never seen rugby played, nor do I know anything about it.  Is there even a ball??  Other than a few guys with awesome leg muscles, I''m not really sure what''s going on here.  That''s my fault though, not yours.  My only complaint is a small one.  The guy to the left in blue, has his hands out, but the shadow from the right arm is covering part of the left hand, kind of making it blend into the background.  Otherwise, lighting and focus are good. angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how you have gotten all 3 guys in the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(190361, 11003, 5834, '<td valign="top">wery good picture!! i like it!<br/></td>', 'wery good picture!! i like it!', '2003-01-14 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(190366, 10721, 3585, '<td valign="top">fun, simple and well shot, my favorite this week</td>', 'fun, simple and well shot, my favorite this week', '2003-01-14 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(190398, 10886, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is pretty darn funny.  Probably only to those that saw the "original" though.  There is a funny shadow on the top of the finger towards the far left.  Otherwise, the angle and framing/cropping are good, lighting is good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  Made me laugh out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is pretty darn funny.  Probably only to those that saw the "original" though.  There is a funny shadow on the top of the finger towards the far left.  Otherwise, the angle and framing/cropping are good, lighting is good, and the focus and clarity are also good.  Made me laugh out loud.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(190404, 11030, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL.  I feel that way myself sometimes.  Very funny stuff.  Focus and clarity are good, angle and framing/cropping are also good.  The glares off the balloons and vaccuum aren''t distracting, but quite noticable.  I like how they look like little aliens.  bet it was fun getting those balloons on his (her?) feet.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'LOL.  I feel that way myself sometimes.  Very funny stuff.  Focus and clarity are good, angle and framing/cropping are also good.  The glares off the balloons and vaccuum aren''t distracting, but quite noticable.  I like how they look like little aliens.  bet it was fun getting those balloons on his (her?) feet.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(190406, 11003, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really very similar to john''s entry, easily recognisable, which is great :) I think to improve it a bit it should be made a little more obvious what the snack is. I guess it is a hotdog (double meaning? hehe) but it isnt really that clear. Maybe placing that at a different rotation would help. The skin is quite strange as well. Maybe you have used neatimage? Some areas have no texture at al, and some do. It is a little bit off-putting but not at all bad :)<br/> <br/>Overall nice humour photo :)</td>', 'This is really very similar to john''s entry, easily recognisable, which is great :) I think to improve it a bit it should be made a little more obvious what the snack is. I guess it is a hotdog (double meaning? hehe) but it isnt really that clear. Maybe placing that at a different rotation would help. The skin is quite strange as well. Maybe you have used neatimage? Some areas have no texture at al, and some do. It is a little bit off-putting but not at all bad :) Overall nice humour photo :)', '2003-01-14 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(190409, 10991, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good idea. The composition is quite centered, but in this case I think it works well. To improve it I think you should have used string instead of ribbon to tie the pen on, because the pattern of the ribbon and the way it twists is quite busy, taking away from the hand in my opinion. Still, one of the best I think :)</td>', 'Really good idea. The composition is quite centered, but in this case I think it works well. To improve it I think you should have used string instead of ribbon to tie the pen on, because the pattern of the ribbon and the way it twists is quite busy, taking away from the hand in my opinion. Still, one of the best I think :)', '2003-01-14 10:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(190411, 10868, 3080, '<td valign="top">Humor is funny, but this isn''t real funny.  The lighting isn''t real great.  I would think that the paper would be white, rather than a shadowy dull color.  Nice art work.  Focus is really good, I''ll give you that.  I think a white level adjustment is in order though.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Humor is funny, but this isn''t real funny.  The lighting isn''t real great.  I would think that the paper would be white, rather than a shadowy dull color.  Nice art work.  Focus is really good, I''ll give you that.  I think a white level adjustment is in order though.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(190412, 10974, 2780, '<td valign="top">lol, this is great. Really suitable expression and the composition is basically perfect. Along with the title this is a really funny photo :)<br/> <br/>One suggestion I have is to darken it a little. At the moment all the shadowed areas look blue, rather than black, especially noticable on the face.</td>', 'lol, this is great. Really suitable expression and the composition is basically perfect. Along with the title this is a really funny photo :) One suggestion I have is to darken it a little. At the moment all the shadowed areas look blue, rather than black, especially noticable on the face.', '2003-01-14 10:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(190413, 10721, 3080, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, this did make me laugh.  It''s not ''set up'' looking, and it looks like a frog.  A cartoon frog, of course.  Pretty funny find.  I love the use of black and white here.  Focus and clarity are really good.  Angle and framing/cropping are excelent as well.  I think the central positioning of the tractor(?) is good.  Great eye! Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Strangely enough, this did make me laugh.  It''s not ''set up'' looking, and it looks like a frog.  A cartoon frog, of course.  Pretty funny find.  I love the use of black and white here.  Focus and clarity are really good.  Angle and framing/cropping are excelent as well.  I think the central positioning of the tractor(?) is good.  Great eye! Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(190415, 10829, 3080, '<td valign="top">Even without the title, the sad look of the snowman is pretty funny.  I kind of wish there was a bit of light on the front of him, but snow is often really hard to capture nicely, and the extra light would probably make it even harder.  Very catchy title.  Made my brother laugh too.  I like the angle and framing/cropping. The platform he''s sitting on looks very nice within the photo.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Even without the title, the sad look of the snowman is pretty funny.  I kind of wish there was a bit of light on the front of him, but snow is often really hard to capture nicely, and the extra light would probably make it even harder.  Very catchy title.  Made my brother laugh too.  I like the angle and framing/cropping. The platform he''s sitting on looks very nice within the photo.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(190418, 10896, 3080, '<td valign="top">What is funny about this shot, to me, is the fact that he''s really trying to talk to her, hand gestures and all, and she looks to be in outter space.  Not even looking at him.  (without even looking at the title) The objects in the back indicate some drinking, and that''s pretty funny.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting appears to be ok as well.  Maybe a tad harsh on the girls face, but not serious.  Good angle and framing/cropping as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What is funny about this shot, to me, is the fact that he''s really trying to talk to her, hand gestures and all, and she looks to be in outter space.  Not even looking at him.  (without even looking at the title) The objects in the back indicate some drinking, and that''s pretty funny.  Focus and clarity are good, and lighting appears to be ok as well.  Maybe a tad harsh on the girls face, but not serious.  Good angle and framing/cropping as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190425, 11039, 3080, '<td valign="top">holy cow!  does someone live there? very strange.  I think this is pretty darn funny.  The angle and framing/cropping are just fine.  focus and clarity are good.  The sky is a blown out white though, and that''s not a serious problem, but just an observation.  Mine always turn out that way too.  *shrug*  nice shot. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'holy cow!  does someone live there? very strange.  I think this is pretty darn funny.  The angle and framing/cropping are just fine.  focus and clarity are good.  The sky is a blown out white though, and that''s not a serious problem, but just an observation.  Mine always turn out that way too.  *shrug*  nice shot. good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(190432, 11003, 3080, '<td valign="top">You cut off her butt.  I think that dampens the effect of all the curves, but I supose no one will care about that.    I like the lighting.  no glares, hot spots of annoying shadows.  There is a shadow on her back, but I think that''s good, not bad.  Can''t wait to see "Forbidden Breakfast"  and "Forbidden Brunch".  "Forbidden vegatables" should be interesting.  The background works very well here.  Nothing distracting and very complimentary to her skin.  Focus and clarity are about as good as it gets.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You cut off her butt.  I think that dampens the effect of all the curves, but I supose no one will care about that.    I like the lighting.  no glares, hot spots of annoying shadows.  There is a shadow on her back, but I think that''s good, not bad.  Can''t wait to see "Forbidden Breakfast"  and "Forbidden Brunch".  "Forbidden vegatables" should be interesting.  The background works very well here.  Nothing distracting and very complimentary to her skin.  Focus and clarity are about as good as it gets.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(190433, 10927, 3080, '<td valign="top">He looks ill.  LOL!  This was quite funny.  Reminds me of the photo in the 7sins challenge of the ill looking boy on the floor eating the whole bag of cookies.  The colors in this shot are excelent.  Very bright, nice and vivid.  I wonder how the border would look reversed.  Having a thin black line, with a thicker blue line.  Something to try anyway.  The focus and clarity are great here.  An very clean, clear shot.  and quite funny.  one of my favorites this week.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He looks ill.  LOL!  This was quite funny.  Reminds me of the photo in the 7sins challenge of the ill looking boy on the floor eating the whole bag of cookies.  The colors in this shot are excelent.  Very bright, nice and vivid.  I wonder how the border would look reversed.  Having a thin black line, with a thicker blue line.  Something to try anyway.  The focus and clarity are great here.  An very clean, clear shot.  and quite funny.  one of my favorites this week.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 10:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(190436, 10889, 3080, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  This is just too funny.  One stop shop. lol.  Focus and clarity are great.  angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  At first, the white sky kind of bothered me, but I see it has a greenish tint, and the more I look at it, the more that slight greenish tint works.I think your green border works as well.  Colors are nice and bright, not muted or dull.  Very nice find.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Amazing.  This is just too funny.  One stop shop. lol.  Focus and clarity are great.  angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  At first, the white sky kind of bothered me, but I see it has a greenish tint, and the more I look at it, the more that slight greenish tint works.I think your green border works as well.  Colors are nice and bright, not muted or dull.  Very nice find.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(190439, 10973, 3080, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.  I love the use of black and white here. Excelent contrast in my opinion.  I like how the photo is dark, but the butt really stands out.  Very nice artwork there too.  Focus and clarity are great.  Angle and framing/cropping are great. Lighitng is perfect.  One of my favorite shots this week.  You deserve a top 3.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hilarious.  I love the use of black and white here. Excelent contrast in my opinion.  I like how the photo is dark, but the butt really stands out.  Very nice artwork there too.  Focus and clarity are great.  Angle and framing/cropping are great. Lighitng is perfect.  One of my favorite shots this week.  You deserve a top 3.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-14 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
