(191859, 10839, 4493, '<td valign="top">Some may not see the humor in this, but it a nice commentary on life that everyone needs to cover their @$$, even the chickens!</td>', 'Some may not see the humor in this, but it a nice commentary on life that everyone needs to cover their @$$, even the chickens!', '2003-01-15 12:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(191861, 10819, 4493, '<td valign="top">LOL, once I read the whole thing. You brits have a good sense of humor. Lighting is very effective as well as DOF.</td>', 'LOL, once I read the whole thing. You brits have a good sense of humor. Lighting is very effective as well as DOF.', '2003-01-15 12:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191863, 10952, 4493, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t until I saw the slippers that I laughed out loud. Nice pose. Lighting is a little harsh, but when you''re working with dogs, you get what they give you. Nice shot.</td>', 'It wasn''t until I saw the slippers that I laughed out loud. Nice pose. Lighting is a little harsh, but when you''re working with dogs, you get what they give you. Nice shot.', '2003-01-15 12:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191868, 10813, 4493, '<td valign="top">Staged or not, this is very humorous. The lighting is good, as well as the plant colors. Nice to see a non-cluttered background.</td>', 'Staged or not, this is very humorous. The lighting is good, as well as the plant colors. Nice to see a non-cluttered background.', '2003-01-15 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191904, 10973, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good contrasts, nice amount of negative space.  (Good ribbon graphic, but work on your lettering! no score effect)  I really, really like this.  I''m not sure if it''s a 9 or a 10.  For this site, the humor is VERY good - to the general public....maybe the "sharp" ones will "get it".  10 Swash (this ain''t no gimme!)</td>', 'Very good contrasts, nice amount of negative space.  (Good ribbon graphic, but work on your lettering! no score effect)  I really, really like this.  I''m not sure if it''s a 9 or a 10.  For this site, the humor is VERY good - to the general public....maybe the "sharp" ones will "get it".  10 Swash (this ain''t no gimme!)', '2003-01-15 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(191908, 10829, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great title!  (I would have never thought of it!!!)  At first, I thought the sun should be on "the other side", but that''s what makes the snowman stick out from the background most (not a picture of a snowman in a snow storm!), so good lighting.  The trees in the background tend to muddle the shot to me (Maybe a more downward angle??)  Photo 8, but the title gets you one more...9 Swash</td>', 'Great title!  (I would have never thought of it!!!)  At first, I thought the sun should be on "the other side", but that''s what makes the snowman stick out from the background most (not a picture of a snowman in a snow storm!), so good lighting.  The trees in the background tend to muddle the shot to me (Maybe a more downward angle??)  Photo 8, but the title gets you one more...9 Swash', '2003-01-15 12:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(191917, 10889, 5082, '<td valign="top">Easily the FUNNIEST submission this week, and I like the way you matched the frame color to the sign.<br/> <br/>"Lessee, I''ll take 4 glazed, 4 chocolates, 4 jelly-filled and a box of 30.06 shells..."</td>', 'Easily the FUNNIEST submission this week, and I like the way you matched the frame color to the sign. "Lessee, I''ll take 4 glazed, 4 chocolates, 4 jelly-filled and a box of 30.06 shells..."', '2003-01-15 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(191938, 10886, 4543, '<td valign="top">Is this the latest version of the forbidden fruit?  This is the funniest of them all, perfect 10! Good Job!</td>', 'Is this the latest version of the forbidden fruit?  This is the funniest of them all, perfect 10! Good Job!', '2003-01-15 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(191940, 11029, 4543, '<td valign="top">You sick! You made me laugh.. great shot! 10!</td>', 'You sick! You made me laugh.. great shot! 10!', '2003-01-15 13:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191945, 10813, 2472, '<td valign="top">There are no technical flaws in this execution. The background illumination is very well achieved bringing the viewers sight directly to the subject. At that point, there is a little lack of light right at the union of the flower and the wine (and I am guessing it''s wine, since it''s too dark) If the glass of wine had it''s own transparency with light, the color would nicely match with the red flowers, and I believe it would make this a very special image. Focus is exact. The nuts detail is very good, although the setting looks a little bit too much of a setting, and the perfection of the flowers provides an artificiality feel. As humour goes, I certainly smiled when I saw this. I like this one very much. Congratulations.</td>', 'There are no technical flaws in this execution. The background illumination is very well achieved bringing the viewers sight directly to the subject. At that point, there is a little lack of light right at the union of the flower and the wine (and I am guessing it''s wine, since it''s too dark) If the glass of wine had it''s own transparency with light, the color would nicely match with the red flowers, and I believe it would make this a very special image. Focus is exact. The nuts detail is very good, although the setting looks a little bit too much of a setting, and the perfection of the flowers provides an artificiality feel. As humour goes, I certainly smiled when I saw this. I like this one very much. Congratulations.', '2003-01-15 13:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(191949, 10738, 772, '<td valign="top">This is quite entertaining :)  I think it could be a tad stronger with a different choice of background that would highlight the color of the furbies a little more :)  The high key background doesn''t seem to mesh well with the colors of the toys... great entry though :) = 9 - setzler</td>', 'This is quite entertaining :)  I think it could be a tad stronger with a different choice of background that would highlight the color of the furbies a little more :)  The high key background doesn''t seem to mesh well with the colors of the toys... great entry though :) = 9 - setzler', '2003-01-15 13:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(191950, 10961, 2472, '<td valign="top">This is really funny. It made me smile instantly when I saw the lady''s candid laugh. The perpetrator hands are too rough for a nice looking woman, but his smile is at the right point, unfortunately, he is more in focus than her, and her face is far more illuminated than his (too much, actually), and that is not good. But this is humor, and I like it. Good job!</td>', 'This is really funny. It made me smile instantly when I saw the lady''s candid laugh. The perpetrator hands are too rough for a nice looking woman, but his smile is at the right point, unfortunately, he is more in focus than her, and her face is far more illuminated than his (too much, actually), and that is not good. But this is humor, and I like it. Good job!', '2003-01-15 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(191957, 11030, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very funny and creative. I can think of many settings for this idea, but not necessarily better than the one you chose. Although I understand the idea, IMHO it would have been a little better if there were less distracting elements included in the set, such as only the sofa and the table, without the big blue distracting machine, that flared from your lighting in it''s medium area, and the flag.</td>', 'Very funny and creative. I can think of many settings for this idea, but not necessarily better than the one you chose. Although I understand the idea, IMHO it would have been a little better if there were less distracting elements included in the set, such as only the sofa and the table, without the big blue distracting machine, that flared from your lighting in it''s medium area, and the flag.', '2003-01-15 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(191962, 10886, 2472, '<td valign="top">Very funny and well done. We chose the same photo to make fun with, only I guess I complicated myself a little bit more, and I''m most probably getting the same results as yours anyway. What makes me laugh more, is that tiny apple you found...</td>', 'Very funny and well done. We chose the same photo to make fun with, only I guess I complicated myself a little bit more, and I''m most probably getting the same results as yours anyway. What makes me laugh more, is that tiny apple you found...', '2003-01-15 13:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(191972, 10727, 2472, '<td valign="top">The photo seems pretty good, although it is too small to really appreciate details. The DOF looks good as well, and the subject is well placed. Unfortunately I failed to find the humour in this one.</td>', 'The photo seems pretty good, although it is too small to really appreciate details. The DOF looks good as well, and the subject is well placed. Unfortunately I failed to find the humour in this one.', '2003-01-15 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(191982, 10839, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good shot!  Eggcellent detail!  Good contrast, too.  How in the world did you get the print on the egg?  Fine balance!!!  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good shot!  Eggcellent detail!  Good contrast, too.  How in the world did you get the print on the egg?  Fine balance!!!  8 Swash', '2003-01-15 14:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(191985, 11003, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great model, and a very original idea. HaHa!   My only complaint is the ribbon has a silvery thing next to it causing a distraction.   Maybe I ought to concentrate on the rest of the photo! 9 <br/>P.S. I went back and reviewed the original "Forbidden fruit", and came to the conclusion that if this isn''t yours, John Setzler, then it is a brilliant piece of work in matching skin tones, body form, and lighting!</td>', 'Great model, and a very original idea. HaHa!   My only complaint is the ribbon has a silvery thing next to it causing a distraction.   Maybe I ought to concentrate on the rest of the photo! 9 P.S. I went back and reviewed the original "Forbidden fruit", and came to the conclusion that if this isn''t yours, John Setzler, then it is a brilliant piece of work in matching skin tones, body form, and lighting!', '2003-01-15 14:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(191986, 11014, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken macro, great details!  (looks like contacts and a little irritation!)  (also sort of a joke - where''s the printed message at the bottom of the frame?)<br/>Good job!  8 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken macro, great details!  (looks like contacts and a little irritation!)  (also sort of a joke - where''s the printed message at the bottom of the frame?)Good job!  8 Swash', '2003-01-15 14:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(191990, 10952, 1005, '<td valign="top">Soo cute!  The slippers and necklace are great touches!  (Patient, good dog!)  At first, I didn''t like the sepia effect (I thought it muted the pic), but as I look and comment, I think I see the idea behind it and it pretty much works!   Details of the dog''s face seem a tad soft, like the focus in on the keyboard, but that really could be the sepia doing that - doesn''t affect the score I''m giving you.  8 Swash</td>', 'Soo cute!  The slippers and necklace are great touches!  (Patient, good dog!)  At first, I didn''t like the sepia effect (I thought it muted the pic), but as I look and comment, I think I see the idea behind it and it pretty much works!   Details of the dog''s face seem a tad soft, like the focus in on the keyboard, but that really could be the sepia doing that - doesn''t affect the score I''m giving you.  8 Swash', '2003-01-15 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(191992, 10734, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohh the nudity!  Neat shot!  Funny!  Having her hold her own head is such a great touch!  Your background is - I dunno - I can''t think of a better one, black doesn''t seem like a good idea, but the white, it''s sooo negative (in a glary sort of way) that I''m just not sure I can get fully behind it.  O.K?  7 Swash</td>', 'Ohh the nudity!  Neat shot!  Funny!  Having her hold her own head is such a great touch!  Your background is - I dunno - I can''t think of a better one, black doesn''t seem like a good idea, but the white, it''s sooo negative (in a glary sort of way) that I''m just not sure I can get fully behind it.  O.K?  7 Swash', '2003-01-15 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192026, 10964, 6188, '<td valign="top">ok w''ll humor U</td>', 'ok w''ll humor U', '2003-01-15 15:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(192073, 10721, 715, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it made  laugh so in my opinion it fits the challenge very well.  I''m no to fond about the framing though. I''d like to see  either some more space above the "eyes" or some less space  below the "mouth".  Besides that It''s a great catch.</td>', 'Great shot, it made  laugh so in my opinion it fits the challenge very well.  I''m no to fond about the framing though. I''d like to see  either some more space above the "eyes" or some less space  below the "mouth".  Besides that It''s a great catch.', '2003-01-15 16:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(192077, 10889, 5223, '<td valign="top">This made me lol~then made me sad-very clever photo nice sharp focus and crop -well done</td>', 'This made me lol~then made me sad-very clever photo nice sharp focus and crop -well done', '2003-01-15 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(192079, 10721, 5223, '<td valign="top">Realy good B+W and very clever photo-you have a good eye for a photo nice crop-well done</td>', 'Realy good B+W and very clever photo-you have a good eye for a photo nice crop-well done', '2003-01-15 16:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(192081, 10952, 715, '<td valign="top">The photo seems to be a little blurry on my monitor, but I think it''s the funniest photo of the challenge.</td>', 'The photo seems to be a little blurry on my monitor, but I think it''s the funniest photo of the challenge.', '2003-01-15 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(192095, 10721, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good eye to see this (or did you help?)  Very toothy smile!  Good shot, nice contrast.  Tiniest of suggestions, crop just a tad off the bottom, leave us in suspense whether it ready to run (or in this case on a block).    O.K?  8 Swash</td>', 'Good eye to see this (or did you help?)  Very toothy smile!  Good shot, nice contrast.  Tiniest of suggestions, crop just a tad off the bottom, leave us in suspense whether it ready to run (or in this case on a block).    O.K?  8 Swash', '2003-01-15 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(192103, 10927, 715, '<td valign="top">Funny shot and great idea, but I think iit would have been hilarious if the hair of the boy would be rough. That way it would give a better illusion that he really was in a turning dryer.</td>', 'Funny shot and great idea, but I think iit would have been hilarious if the hair of the boy would be rough. That way it would give a better illusion that he really was in a turning dryer.', '2003-01-15 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(192104, 10782, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot!  What''s up with the back legs...ballerina? (it''s on it''s toes!)  Very good action stop-age!  The background is horrible, but with a photo of opportunity like this, you can''t always get the best backgrounds, so I''ll just ignore it, O.K?  (well, how about minus 1 - I can''t subtract a partial point!)  7 Swash</td>', 'This is a cool shot!  What''s up with the back legs...ballerina? (it''s on it''s toes!)  Very good action stop-age!  The background is horrible, but with a photo of opportunity like this, you can''t always get the best backgrounds, so I''ll just ignore it, O.K?  (well, how about minus 1 - I can''t subtract a partial point!)  7 Swash', '2003-01-15 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(192126, 11027, 5508, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I would have liked to have seen it in colour. But mabey you tried that. In any case good shot.</td>', 'I really like this photo. I would have liked to have seen it in colour. But mabey you tried that. In any case good shot.', '2003-01-15 17:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(192128, 10991, 5508, '<td valign="top">Funny. I think a colourful or just a white background would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Funny. I think a colourful or just a white background would have been a better choice.', '2003-01-15 17:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(192134, 11021, 5508, '<td valign="top">Very funny. The only thing that bothers me is the is the lighting. It gives it a snap shot quality. But I don''t think you had much control over it unless you chose a different enviornment. Creative shot.</td>', 'Very funny. The only thing that bothers me is the is the lighting. It gives it a snap shot quality. But I don''t think you had much control over it unless you chose a different enviornment. Creative shot.', '2003-01-15 17:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(192136, 10727, 5508, '<td valign="top">Everything about this pict is cool. It''s just not that funny.</td>', 'Everything about this pict is cool. It''s just not that funny.', '2003-01-15 17:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(192137, 11003, 715, '<td valign="top">LOL, I wonder who made this one?</td>', 'LOL, I wonder who made this one?', '2003-01-15 17:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(192139, 10727, 2716, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty ad (crazy).  I don''t see much humour in this shot but I do like the depth of field you used, and the overall composition (how the owl fills in most of the fram).  Jakco  8</td>', 'Looks pretty ad (crazy).  I don''t see much humour in this shot but I do like the depth of field you used, and the overall composition (how the owl fills in most of the fram).  Jakco  8', '2003-01-15 17:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(192141, 11015, 5508, '<td valign="top">Great pict. But I\''m suprised alot of people for this challenge elected to go with black as thier backgorund, black is\''nt that funny. Anyway the 2 comment I have on this pict is, yes the black back takes away from the humor, and I would have prefered a different angle on the cutie. One that would show more of the face looking at the camera. Good luck.</td>', 'Great pict. But I\''m suprised alot of people for this challenge elected to go with black as thier backgorund, black is\''nt that funny. Anyway the 2 comment I have on this pict is, yes the black back takes away from the humor, and I would have prefered a different angle on the cutie. One that would show more of the face looking at the camera. Good luck.', '2003-01-15 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(192142, 10767, 2716, '<td valign="top">Poor you, you chose a cat picture for an entry.  Are you at least doing 5?  Just saying that because both my cat submissions tanked real bad.  Having said that, I am a cat person and I love this picture because cats always make me smile.  Good job and good luck.  I like the softness of the cat.  Jacko   9</td>', 'Poor you, you chose a cat picture for an entry.  Are you at least doing 5?  Just saying that because both my cat submissions tanked real bad.  Having said that, I am a cat person and I love this picture because cats always make me smile.  Good job and good luck.  I like the softness of the cat.  Jacko   9', '2003-01-15 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(192143, 10964, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ha ha if you''re a doctor.  lol.  I''m not but I still find it funny.  jacko</td>', 'Ha ha if you''re a doctor.  lol.  I''m not but I still find it funny.  jacko', '2003-01-15 17:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(192144, 10954, 5508, '<td valign="top">Mabey a little bit of a struggling expression would help make it funnier. And mabey taken at a different angle so you could avoid that tree infront. But over all a well executed shot.</td>', 'Mabey a little bit of a struggling expression would help make it funnier. And mabey taken at a different angle so you could avoid that tree infront. But over all a well executed shot.', '2003-01-15 17:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(192145, 10986, 2716, '<td valign="top">Guess what?  I love dead baby jokes.  What''s the difference between a truck load of dead babies and a truck load of bowling balls?  You can''t empty a truckload of bowling balls with a pitch fork.  LOL.  Anyhow, you got balls ... I know people are going to poop on you for this entry.  Jacko.  9  good luck.</td>', 'Guess what?  I love dead baby jokes.  What''s the difference between a truck load of dead babies and a truck load of bowling balls?  You can''t empty a truckload of bowling balls with a pitch fork.  LOL.  Anyhow, you got balls ... I know people are going to poop on you for this entry.  Jacko.  9  good luck.', '2003-01-15 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192146, 11029, 5508, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-01-15 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(192147, 10886, 2716, '<td valign="top">This is definitely my favourite this week.  I love spoofs and this one is the biggest spoof of them all.  Congratulations.  a well deserved 10.</td>', 'This is definitely my favourite this week.  I love spoofs and this one is the biggest spoof of them all.  Congratulations.  a well deserved 10.', '2003-01-15 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(192148, 10927, 2716, '<td valign="top">That''s funny.  The look on his face and the wild hair makes it look like he was actually being tumbled by the dryer.  lol.</td>', 'That''s funny.  The look on his face and the wild hair makes it look like he was actually being tumbled by the dryer.  lol.', '2003-01-15 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192149, 10767, 5508, '<td valign="top">Some of the comments you might be getting are that the cat is not positioned right. Should be more in the frame. I don''t think so. I like your choice, it gives an impression of something happening. The only thing I would have liked more is if the cat was more in focus.</td>', 'Some of the comments you might be getting are that the cat is not positioned right. Should be more in the frame. I don''t think so. I like your choice, it gives an impression of something happening. The only thing I would have liked more is if the cat was more in focus.', '2003-01-15 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(192150, 10989, 2716, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like bamaster.  lol.  I''m not sure if Black and White was the best choice here.  I''d personally like to see it in colour.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Kinda looks like bamaster.  lol.  I''m not sure if Black and White was the best choice here.  I''d personally like to see it in colour.  Jacko.  7', '2003-01-15 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(192151, 10889, 5508, '<td valign="top">Yep that''s my impression of Texas.</td>', 'Yep that''s my impression of Texas.', '2003-01-15 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(192152, 11029, 2716, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  Another spoof.  I like it.  Too bad I don''t know about this Stitch character.  Might have given me bigger chuckles.  Gave me chuckles none the less.</td>', 'Ha ha!  Another spoof.  I like it.  Too bad I don''t know about this Stitch character.  Might have given me bigger chuckles.  Gave me chuckles none the less.', '2003-01-15 17:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(192153, 11013, 2716, '<td valign="top">Funny pic, however the dirty toilette bowl and the wild shower curtain are  distracting to me.  Jacko.  6</td>', 'Funny pic, however the dirty toilette bowl and the wild shower curtain are  distracting to me.  Jacko.  6', '2003-01-15 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(192154, 10826, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yeah.  How can I not give this picture a good score.  Kill the trolls.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Yeah.  How can I not give this picture a good score.  Kill the trolls.  Jacko.  8', '2003-01-15 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(192157, 10836, 2716, '<td valign="top">That''s not funny, that''s sad (takes out the violin).  :)  Don''t see much humour in the shot, but I will give you an 8 because it is technically great.  NIce and crisp.  Just the right depth of field. 8  Jacko.</td>', 'That''s not funny, that''s sad (takes out the violin).  :)  Don''t see much humour in the shot, but I will give you an 8 because it is technically great.  NIce and crisp.  Just the right depth of field. 8  Jacko.', '2003-01-15 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(192158, 11015, 2716, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  this picture will make for great memories.  Jacko.  <br/></td>', 'Adorable.  this picture will make for great memories.  Jacko.  ', '2003-01-15 17:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(192160, 10974, 2716, '<td valign="top">That has to hurt!  ha ha.  An old classice.  A bit too much shadow on the side of the face and the face looks a bit blurry.  Other than that, nicely composed picture.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.</td>', 'That has to hurt!  ha ha.  An old classice.  A bit too much shadow on the side of the face and the face looks a bit blurry.  Other than that, nicely composed picture.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.', '2003-01-15 17:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(192163, 10766, 2716, '<td valign="top">I always wanted a mohawk, but never had the guts.  Now I have a steady job, and I''ll only be able to get one when I retire :(   I find the picture a bit too blurry; needs a bit of focus/dpeth of field/sharpening.  Cropping is good, with the subject filling in the picture nicely.  Jacko.</td>', 'I always wanted a mohawk, but never had the guts.  Now I have a steady job, and I''ll only be able to get one when I retire :(   I find the picture a bit too blurry; needs a bit of focus/dpeth of field/sharpening.  Cropping is good, with the subject filling in the picture nicely.  Jacko.', '2003-01-15 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(192164, 10848, 5508, '<td valign="top">This photo seems squished. Anyway I don''t get it, or it''s not that funny. But enough with my useless negative comments. WOW! on the composition. Did you ask these JackAsses to pose for ya? The only minor thing is that you have alot of space on top that has nothing to do with the gag. Crop your image from the top of the hay. You''ll see it''s a much better photo.</td>', 'This photo seems squished. Anyway I don''t get it, or it''s not that funny. But enough with my useless negative comments. WOW! on the composition. Did you ask these JackAsses to pose for ya? The only minor thing is that you have alot of space on top that has nothing to do with the gag. Crop your image from the top of the hay. You''ll see it''s a much better photo.', '2003-01-15 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
