(192330, 10961, 3294, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great!  I love the fact that she''s not even flinching at this.  Tells me that their relationship is healthy.  And what''s with that guy''s goofy smile?  Absolutely perfect!  Two unique personalities... I love these shots!  Technically, the shot is off center and just a tiny bit soft on the focus, or maybe that''s motion blur.  Her face is brighter than his is, being closer to the light I think.  The logo on his shirt is a little distracting.  I take one point away for the tech stuff!  (9)</td>', 'Oh this is great!  I love the fact that she''s not even flinching at this.  Tells me that their relationship is healthy.  And what''s with that guy''s goofy smile?  Absolutely perfect!  Two unique personalities... I love these shots!  Technically, the shot is off center and just a tiny bit soft on the focus, or maybe that''s motion blur.  Her face is brighter than his is, being closer to the light I think.  The logo on his shirt is a little distracting.  I take one point away for the tech stuff!  (9)', '2003-01-15 21:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(192332, 10974, 3294, '<td valign="top">hehe cute!  Lighting is good, but the focus is soft... although I am finding many in this challenge are.  I really like the background... nice tonal balance.  Great exposure... what is that red thing on his shirt at the bottom there?  dunno.  (7)</td>', 'hehe cute!  Lighting is good, but the focus is soft... although I am finding many in this challenge are.  I really like the background... nice tonal balance.  Great exposure... what is that red thing on his shirt at the bottom there?  dunno.  (7)', '2003-01-15 21:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
