(193297, 10949, 2989, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot.  The flsh or the light illuminates this shot well, not taking away from it like it can so easily do.</td>', 'Very cute shot.  The flsh or the light illuminates this shot well, not taking away from it like it can so easily do.', '2003-01-17 09:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(193298, 11027, 2989, '<td valign="top">He looks so happy in this shot, a great portrayal of humor.  The lighting on the left side makes this shot more interesting.  A smilar light source on the right side might have improved this already well done shot.</td>', 'He looks so happy in this shot, a great portrayal of humor.  The lighting on the left side makes this shot more interesting.  A smilar light source on the right side might have improved this already well done shot.', '2003-01-17 09:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(193299, 10782, 2989, '<td valign="top">The way this shot was taken, it almost looks like this cat is floatin and his hind legs are in the air.  Funny shot</td>', 'The way this shot was taken, it almost looks like this cat is floatin and his hind legs are in the air.  Funny shot', '2003-01-17 09:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(193300, 10836, 2989, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject.  I don''t feel that you used an older regular picture for this challenge as I usually do when the subject is something like this.  The blurred background keeps the shot at a level that isn''t distracting and only draws your eye to the bird.  Great lighting on the bird too!... 10</td>', 'Very interesting subject.  I don''t feel that you used an older regular picture for this challenge as I usually do when the subject is something like this.  The blurred background keeps the shot at a level that isn''t distracting and only draws your eye to the bird.  Great lighting on the bird too!... 10', '2003-01-17 09:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(193301, 10721, 2989, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t see the humor till I stopped for a moment and looked at it simply.  It is a great find, and surely made me laugh out loud.  The b &amp; w really helps this shot and keeps it from being distracting....10</td>', 'I couldn''t see the humor till I stopped for a moment and looked at it simply.  It is a great find, and surely made me laugh out loud.  The b & w really helps this shot and keeps it from being distracting....10', '2003-01-17 09:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(193302, 11045, 2989, '<td valign="top">Funny humor.  To improve this shot I would have worked on a more interesting warmer lighting.  The bright lights make the cookie appear very dull in color.</td>', 'Funny humor.  To improve this shot I would have worked on a more interesting warmer lighting.  The bright lights make the cookie appear very dull in color.', '2003-01-17 09:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(193304, 10883, 2989, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The focus and lighting works perfect in this case.  The cropping also makes for some great composition.  Very well done, I hope to see this do well...10</td>', 'I love this shot.  The focus and lighting works perfect in this case.  The cropping also makes for some great composition.  Very well done, I hope to see this do well...10', '2003-01-17 09:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193327, 11045, 107, '<td valign="top">LOL.</td>', 'LOL.', '2003-01-17 10:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(193336, 10721, 2553, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell whether this shot was "setup" or whether it was, shall we say "candid", but nevertheless, it definitely made me smile !  I like the black and white.  I might have liked a more daring/dynamic composition, but this works too. DOF works well for this photo.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell whether this shot was "setup" or whether it was, shall we say "candid", but nevertheless, it definitely made me smile !  I like the black and white.  I might have liked a more daring/dynamic composition, but this works too. DOF works well for this photo.', '2003-01-17 10:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(193338, 10886, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m sure glad you added the little booties, they make all the difference to the composition!  This made my husband and I both laugh, as I''m sure it did a lot of peeps.  Great lighting on this shot, and good composition.</td>', 'I''m sure glad you added the little booties, they make all the difference to the composition!  This made my husband and I both laugh, as I''m sure it did a lot of peeps.  Great lighting on this shot, and good composition.', '2003-01-17 10:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193343, 10889, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is most definitely one of my favorites in the humor challenge, and my husband couldn''t stop laughing!  The humor aspect is the saving grace of this photo, because other than that it would have a low impact for me.  The composition is good in relation to photographing that huge sign, and I must admit I like your border - it accents rather than taking away from the shot.  This sign was a stroke of genius for this challenge though !!</td>', 'This is most definitely one of my favorites in the humor challenge, and my husband couldn''t stop laughing!  The humor aspect is the saving grace of this photo, because other than that it would have a low impact for me.  The composition is good in relation to photographing that huge sign, and I must admit I like your border - it accents rather than taking away from the shot.  This sign was a stroke of genius for this challenge though !!', '2003-01-17 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(193344, 10991, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is just too hilarious!  Both my husband and I laughed for quite a while over this one!  Your lighting is good, but I would have liked a more daring/dynamic composition.  The "palm pilot" is almost overwhelmed by all that negative space.</td>', 'This is just too hilarious!  Both my husband and I laughed for quite a while over this one!  Your lighting is good, but I would have liked a more daring/dynamic composition.  The "palm pilot" is almost overwhelmed by all that negative space.', '2003-01-17 10:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(193345, 11045, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, good composition, and a really cute concept make this one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Great lighting, good composition, and a really cute concept make this one of my favorites this week.', '2003-01-17 10:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(193346, 10828, 2553, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot, and definitely made me smile!  Good composition and terrific lighting. I really would have liked more "eye contact" to give the shot a little more "spark".</td>', 'Adorable shot, and definitely made me smile!  Good composition and terrific lighting. I really would have liked more "eye contact" to give the shot a little more "spark".', '2003-01-17 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(193347, 10836, 2553, '<td valign="top">Funny, yes, but also made me kind of sad.  I feel sorry for the poor thing!  Great lighting and composition, wonderful DOF, and I love the interest of the rusty rail.</td>', 'Funny, yes, but also made me kind of sad.  I feel sorry for the poor thing!  Great lighting and composition, wonderful DOF, and I love the interest of the rusty rail.', '2003-01-17 10:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(193356, 11021, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just can''t look at this without cracking up!  What an imagination you have !! Almost scary!  Lighting and composition are good, and I don''t even mind the distraction of the interior of the car since it sets the sense of "place".</td>', 'I just can''t look at this without cracking up!  What an imagination you have !! Almost scary!  Lighting and composition are good, and I don''t even mind the distraction of the interior of the car since it sets the sense of "place".', '2003-01-17 10:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(193360, 11029, 2553, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn cute!  Love the concept!  Great lighting and composition.  Would love to know how you did your lighting for this shot.  I have such a hard time with studio lighting.</td>', 'Pretty darn cute!  Love the concept!  Great lighting and composition.  Would love to know how you did your lighting for this shot.  I have such a hard time with studio lighting.', '2003-01-17 10:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(193366, 10883, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is cute, and I like the composition, but would really have liked to have seen the kitty in better focus.</td>', 'This is cute, and I like the composition, but would really have liked to have seen the kitty in better focus.', '2003-01-17 11:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(193445, 10991, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite submission for the humor challenge.  Nice job... it definitely got your point across while at the same time managing to be a very nice photo.  I especially like the fact that you used a woman''s hand for the photo, I think it adds to it :-)  The lighting on here is excellent, and I like your choice of centering and horizontal photo, I think the black space really helps draw your eyes to the hand.  Excellent job!  Good luck!  -10-</td>', 'This is my favorite submission for the humor challenge.  Nice job... it definitely got your point across while at the same time managing to be a very nice photo.  I especially like the fact that you used a woman''s hand for the photo, I think it adds to it :-)  The lighting on here is excellent, and I like your choice of centering and horizontal photo, I think the black space really helps draw your eyes to the hand.  Excellent job!  Good luck!  -10-', '2003-01-17 12:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(193449, 10974, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely great, and very funny!  Nice job... I love theexpression on his face, and I think that the composition is excellent as well.  The lighting is pretty good... I like the fact there is more light on the leeft side of the photo which I think adds to the pencil coming out of the guys nose.  The one thing I might have tried to watch out for is the little red thing on his shirt... even though it is a tiny thing, it takes my eyes from his face quite a bit.  Still a solid 9... good luck!</td>', 'This is absolutely great, and very funny!  Nice job... I love theexpression on his face, and I think that the composition is excellent as well.  The lighting is pretty good... I like the fact there is more light on the leeft side of the photo which I think adds to the pencil coming out of the guys nose.  The one thing I might have tried to watch out for is the little red thing on his shirt... even though it is a tiny thing, it takes my eyes from his face quite a bit.  Still a solid 9... good luck!', '2003-01-17 12:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(193454, 11045, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is great, I wish I could get a fortune cookie like that and that it would come true!  Great composition, I really like the 3-d look to this, given to it by the shadow that falls over the cookie.  The only thing I might try to be aware of next time is your background, and the white fuzz or spots on it.  Otherwise great photo!  -9- Good luck!</td>', 'This is great, I wish I could get a fortune cookie like that and that it would come true!  Great composition, I really like the 3-d look to this, given to it by the shadow that falls over the cookie.  The only thing I might try to be aware of next time is your background, and the white fuzz or spots on it.  Otherwise great photo!  -9- Good luck!', '2003-01-17 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(193460, 10973, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is DPChallenge at a new level!  I really like your idea here, I think it''s very funny... at least I hope it is, and that it isn''t real ;-)  Great photo... I love your composition... I love the framing of the tattoo by the clothing.  I would have liked more contrast, but thats just me.  Good choice of black and white though.  Good luck!  -8-</td>', 'This is DPChallenge at a new level!  I really like your idea here, I think it''s very funny... at least I hope it is, and that it isn''t real ;-)  Great photo... I love your composition... I love the framing of the tattoo by the clothing.  I would have liked more contrast, but thats just me.  Good choice of black and white though.  Good luck!  -8-', '2003-01-17 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
