(193500, 11014, 2472, '<td valign="top">IMHO this lacks originality, since we''ve seen more than our share of eye macros in DPC. I wonder why you chose B&amp;W, loosing the color of the iris. There seems to be a contact lens in place, ¿why keep it?</td>', 'IMHO this lacks originality, since we''ve seen more than our share of eye macros in DPC. I wonder why you chose B&W, loosing the color of the iris. There seems to be a contact lens in place, ¿why keep it?', '2003-01-17 13:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
