(195166, 10721, 674, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/>Subject A Smiling Tractor, Which made me smile too!<br/> <br/>Sharpness: <br/>good the image doesn''t show any artfacts from oversharpening<br/>Exposure:  A little dark in the lower part of the image.<br/>Contrast &amp; Color:  Good <br/>Composition<br/>As you look at the photo your eyes are drawn to the subject<br/> <br/>Suggestions for improvement: <br/>Perhaps experiment with different lighting, and boosting the EV a bit.<br/>Congratulations on a photo that is very humorous!<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique ClubSubject A Smiling Tractor, Which made me smile too! Sharpness: good the image doesn''t show any artfacts from oversharpeningExposure:  A little dark in the lower part of the image.Contrast & Color:  Good CompositionAs you look at the photo your eyes are drawn to the subject Suggestions for improvement: Perhaps experiment with different lighting, and boosting the EV a bit.Congratulations on a photo that is very humorous!', '2003-01-20 02:52:09.000000', NULL, 0),
