(195646, 10883, 1280, '<td valign="top">CC comment by Grayce aka Gracious<br/> <br/>Sometimes soft focus is fine.  It is very difficult with cats, to get crisp action shots.  A crisper focus would have been better but so what!  Considering all the work you put into this, you did a fine job.  You certainly pulled off the idea. <br/>Your perspective is nice, and everything is composed well. What makes the whole image believable, is that a key is depressed.  That really works!<br/>The pink of her ears, and the wood tones, add warmth to the picture.<br/>Over all, I like it.</td>', 'CC comment by Grayce aka Gracious Sometimes soft focus is fine.  It is very difficult with cats, to get crisp action shots.  A crisper focus would have been better but so what!  Considering all the work you put into this, you did a fine job.  You certainly pulled off the idea. Your perspective is nice, and everything is composed well. What makes the whole image believable, is that a key is depressed.  That really works!The pink of her ears, and the wood tones, add warmth to the picture.Over all, I like it.', '2003-01-20 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(195663, 10935, 1280, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>Yeah...lol  I bet that is "Hard at work" for lots of people.  This meets the challenge well and the colors work well together.<br/>The focus is a little soft, but it''s not easy to focus on yourself...u can''t be in two places at the same time.<br/>Overall, this idea is good, and has potential.  I''d recommend using a model other than yourself, so you can concentrate on composition and focus.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by HBunch - CC status removed.</i></td>', ' Yeah...lol  I bet that is "Hard at work" for lots of people.  This meets the challenge well and the colors work well together.The focus is a little soft, but it''s not easy to focus on yourself...u can''t be in two places at the same time.Overall, this idea is good, and has potential.  I''d recommend using a model other than yourself, so you can concentrate on composition and focus.Message edited by HBunch - CC status removed.', '2003-01-20 11:56:20.000000', NULL, 0),
